# Play test of the plan 'Raft Remade' (CIPlay plan_raft_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'): Raft's story from its start;
# every story island's place is taken by its remade version, found on the Receiver, played to its end with its own
# test - and its quest done unlocks the next one.
plan Raft Remade
note RadioTower
expect chain radiotower unlocked
tune radiotower
include radio_tower_remade.play
expect chain radiotower done
expect chain vasagatan unlocked
tune vasagatan
include vasagatan_remade.play
expect chain vasagatan done
expect chain balboa unlocked
tune balboa
include balboa_remade.play
expect chain balboa done
expect chain caravan unlocked
tune caravan
include caravan_town_remade.play
expect chain caravan done
expect chain tangaroa unlocked
tune tangaroa
include tangaroa_remade.play
expect chain tangaroa done
expect chain varuna unlocked
tune varuna
include varuna_point_remade.play
expect chain varuna done
expect chain temperance unlocked
tune temperance
include temperance_remade.play
expect chain temperance done
expect chain utopia unlocked
tune utopia
include utopia_remade.play
expect chain utopia done
plan end
